#: src/ui/login.rs:170
msgid ""
"That doesn't look like a Client ID. It is 32 letters and digits, shown on "
"Spotify's page for your registration."
msgstr ""
"Cela ne ressemble pas à un Client ID. Il compte 32 lettres et chiffres et "
"figure sur la page de Spotify consacrée à votre inscription."

